# 🏠 HomesPlugin
**Player homes plugin for NexoraSMP — Paper 1.21.4**

---

## 📋 Overview
HomesPlugin allows players to set, teleport to, and manage personal home locations. Features a 54-slot chest GUI for browsing homes, per-rank home limits via LuckPerms, and configurable teleport cooldowns.

---

## 🚀 Installation
1. Place `HomesPlugin.jar` in your `plugins/` folder
2. Restart your server
3. Configure `plugins/HomesPlugin/config.yml`

---

## 💬 Commands

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `/sethome <name>` | Set a home at your current location |
| `/home <name>` | Teleport to a home |
| `/home` | Open the homes GUI (no argument) |
| `/delhome <name>` | Delete a home |
| `/homes` | Open your homes GUI |
| `/homes <player>` | View another player's homes (admin) |
| `/homelist` | List all your homes in chat |

---

## 🔑 Permissions

### Player Permissions
| Permission | Description |
|---|---|
| `homes.use` | Basic home commands — set, teleport, delete |
| `homes.gui` | Access the homes GUI |
| `homes.list` | Use `/homelist` |

### Home Limit Permissions
Assign these in LuckPerms to control how many homes each rank can have:

| Permission | Homes Allowed |
|---|---|
| `homes.limit.1` | 1 home |
| `homes.limit.2` | 2 homes |
| `homes.limit.3` | 3 homes |
| `homes.limit.5` | 5 homes |
| `homes.limit.10` | 10 homes |
| `homes.unlimited` | Unlimited homes |

### Cooldown Bypass Permissions
| Permission | Description |
|---|---|
| `homes.cooldown.bypass` | Skip teleport cooldown entirely |
| `homes.warmup.bypass` | Skip teleport warmup entirely |

### Admin Permissions
| Permission | Description |
|---|---|
| `homes.admin` | View and manage other players' homes |
| `homes.admin.delete` | Delete other players' homes |
| `homes.reload` | Reload the config |

---

## 🎖️ LuckPerms Setup

Assign home limits to your ranks using LuckPerms:

```bash
# Give default rank 3 homes
/lp group default permission set homes.limit.3 true

# Give VIP rank 5 homes
/lp group vip permission set homes.limit.5 true

# Give Elite rank 10 homes
/lp group elite permission set homes.limit.10 true

# Give staff unlimited homes
/lp group staff permission set homes.unlimited true

# Give staff cooldown bypass
/lp group staff permission set homes.cooldown.bypass true
```

---

## 🖥️ GUI (`/homes`)

- **54-slot chest GUI** showing all your set homes
- Each home displayed as a **player head** or map item
- Shows home name, world, and coordinates in the lore
- Click a home to teleport to it instantly
- Homes sorted alphabetically
- Overflow pages if you have more than 45 homes

---

## ⏱️ Cooldowns & Warmup

| Setting | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|
| Teleport warmup | 3 seconds | Player must stand still before teleporting |
| Teleport cooldown | 30 seconds | Wait time between home teleports |

> Moving or taking damage during warmup cancels the teleport.
> Bypass with `homes.cooldown.bypass` or `homes.warmup.bypass`.

---

## 📁 Config Overview (`config.yml`)

```yaml
# Default home limit (overridden by LuckPerms permission nodes)
default-home-limit: 3

# Teleport warmup in seconds (0 to disable)
teleport-warmup: 3

# Teleport cooldown in seconds (0 to disable)
teleport-cooldown: 30

# Allow homes to be set in all worlds
allow-all-worlds: true

# Worlds where homes cannot be set
blacklisted-worlds:
  - world_nether
  - world_the_end

messages:
  home-set: "&aHome &e{name} &aset!"
  home-teleport: "&aTeleporting to &e{name}&a..."
  home-deleted: "&cHome &e{name} &cdeleted."
  cooldown: "&cYou must wait &e{time} &cbefore teleporting again."
  warmup: "&aTeleporting in &e{time} &aseconds. Don't move!"
  warmup-cancelled: "&cTeleport cancelled."
  no-home: "&cHome &e{name} &cdoes not exist."
  limit-reached: "&cYou have reached your home limit of &e{limit}&c."
```

---

## 💾 Data Storage
- Homes saved per player in `plugins/HomesPlugin/homes.yml`
- Stores home name, world, X, Y, Z, yaw, pitch
- Data persists across restarts

